{"17fbb99d-2c27-486f-90a1-2540f4227818":{"id":"17fbb99d-2c27-486f-90a1-2540f4227818","title":"Shibou Yuugi de Meshi wo Kuu.","altTitle":"Playing Death Games to Put Food on the Table","description":"Nama pemain: Yuki\nBerumur 17 tahun, mata pencaharian adalah death game.\n\nHadiah uang dalam jumlah yang besar, dengan nyawa taruhannya. \nPeserta Terbatas hanya untuk gadis cantik. \n\nBisnis pertunjukan yang benar-benar diperuntukkan untuk membuat orang mati. Baginya \"Permainan kematian\"  adalah panggilan hidup, dan tujuan hidup. \n\nEntah apa alasannya, dia tetap teguh pada pendiriannya bahwa tempat ini adalah tempat dia seharusnya berada. \nCantik menawan. Tidak memiliki ampun. \n\nMenembus garis hidup dan mati tanpa batas yang mempesona. \nDengan enteng. Dengan putus asa.\n\nUntuk meraih \"99 kemenangan beruntun\" yang belum pernah dicapai siapa pun!","year":2023,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Thriller","Action","Drama","Mystery"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/17fbb99d-2c27-486f-90a1-2540f4227818/3973d44d-b898-450c-8dfd-3f2782ab8773.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["pt-br","id","es-la","en","vi","fr"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.58,"follows":15066,"listAt":"2026-10-25T18:53:00.544Z","chapters":[{"id":"fa5829f7-9f2c-4223-8ac8-af5f2b94ceae","number":"28","volume":"5","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":15,"createdAt":"2026-07-21T13:49:07+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"bde7e3b7-22c7-4410-9c6a-32b19093c579","number":"27","volume":"5","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":32,"createdAt":"2026-06-17T15:20:53+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"6d79f290-49b7-453f-9a20-a7cd5e90cd6a","number":"26","volume":"5","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":31,"createdAt":"2026-05-20T13:50:20+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"56f848cc-7fa3-4b33-9f11-8854dc4a98a0","number":"25","volume":"5","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":29,"createdAt":"2026-04-22T13:58:11+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"781f6585-351b-4ac5-abe8-9004eb612d8d","n